From 64cb00961b7068d7e05941e6b4ac0c18d0282b19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eddy Sangalli <eddyrodrigues@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:06:15 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] feat(broadcast): integrate native audio, independent
 outputs and recovery-safe video resets

Integrate Master/bus routing, private call audio, NDI Fill+Key, OMT PA16,
DeckLink configuration, encoder properties and 98 native preferences.
Preserve inactive RAW output bindings across video resets and expose replay
frame cursors and global shortcuts. Sources match the locally verified build.

Official SDK headers retain their upstream text and license notices.
